      "content": "idk im just dreading going to the doctor if its nothing big. the amoxicillin is a pretty strong dose and i usually take it for like 7 days when i have an infection so it should work right? if i just take the full amount of what i have left it should clear it up, right? i dont want to wait and have it turn into something worse like strep or something",
